<p>Very cool article. Nice work.</p>
<p>The crosslinks to other SCPs actually took away from the article for me. I might be alone in that opinion, but I've always felt that an article that works without leaning on other articles at all is ideal. In this specific article's case, being a meta riff on canon, it's not nearly as bad a thing, but I honestly groan every time I hover over a link to 049 or 2000, among others.</p>
